      "source": "This is intended as a coarse-grained mechanism for delegating requests to\none of several applications -- each represented by an <code>HttpHandler</code>, with\nthe application \"context path\" (the prefix-based mapping) exposed via\n<a href=\"ServerHttpRequest.html#getPath()\"><code>ServerHttpRequest.getPath()</code></a>.",
